I have written the code for `solution.py` as requested in `TASK.md`. The script reads text from standard input and counts all English vowels (a, e, i, o, u) regardless of case.
The task in `TASK.md` has been completed. I have written the vowel-counting logic to `solution.py`.

```python
def count_vowels(text):
    vowels = "aeiouAEIOU"
    return sum(1 for char in text if char in vowels)

if __name__ == "__main__":
    import sys
    input_text = sys.stdin.read()
    print(count_vowels(input_text))
```
